ges came loose and wooden drawer track needs realignment. Need skilled carpenter with cordless drill and wood glue.\",\n                    serviceType = \"Carpentry\",\n                    latitude = 18.5089,\n                    longitude = 73.8258,\n                    address = \"A-12, Kothrud Gardens, DP Road, Pune\",\n                    budget = 750.0,\n                    isNegotiable = true,\n                    urgencyLevel = UrgencyLevel.STANDARD.name,\n                    status = JobStatus.PENDING.name,\n                    escrowStatus = EscrowStatus.NONE.name,\n                    clientId = 4L,\n                    clientName = \"Dr. Neha Kulkarni\",\n                    workerId = null,\n                    workerName = null,\n                    createdAt = now - (2 * 3600 * 1000),\n                    distanceKm = 5.4\n                ),\n                JobEntity(\n                    id = 4L,\n                    title = \"Split AC Deep Jet Service & Gas Check\",\n                    description = \"1.5 ton Daikin inverter AC not cooling adequately. Needs indoor blower jet cleaning, coil treatment, and R32 pressure top-up.\",\n                    serviceType = \"AC & HVAC Servicing\",\n                    latitude = 18.5590,\n                    longitude = 73.7868,\n                    address = \"Tower 3, Baner Pashan Link Rd, Baner\",\n                    budget = 900.0,\n                    isNegotiable = true,\n                    urgencyLevel = UrgencyLevel.STANDARD.name,\n                    status = JobStatus.PENDING.name,\n                    escrowStatus = EscrowStatus.NONE.name,\n                    clientId = 5L,\n                    clientName = \"Vikram Shenoy\",\n                    workerId = null,\n                    workerName = null,\n                    createdAt = now - (4 * 3600 * 1000),\n                    distanceKm = 8.1\n                ),\n                // A job posted by current user (Client mode)\n               