  checkpoint {
    session_summary: "### 1. Outstanding User Requests\n- **Build an Android app:** The user wants a two-sided trade services marketplace app (\"Sahaya\").\n  - **Status:** IMPLEMENTATION.\n  - **Details:** The data layer (Room database, Repository, Models) is complete. The next phase is to implement the UI/UX and navigation.\n\n### 2. User Knowledge\n- **App Concept:** \"Two-sided trade services marketplace connecting clients with skilled workers for home repairs, emergency services, and escrow bookings.\"\n- **App Name:** \"Sahaya\"\n- **User Preference:** The user wants a functional Android app built from the provided starter template.\n- **Scope:** The app should support user roles (Client/Worker), job posting, escrow functionality, and service requests.\n\n### 3. Work Accomplished\n- **Project Initialization:**\n  - Renamed the project to \"Sahaya\" in `metadata.json`, `settings.gradle.kts`, and `strings.xml`.\n  - Configured a unique `applicationId` (`com.aistudio.sahaya.mktplc`) in `app/build.gradle.kts`.\n- **Branding:**\n  - Created custom adaptive app icon assets (`ic_launcher_background.xml` and `ic_launcher_foreground.xml`) using a dark-to-teal gradient and a craftsman crest design.\n- **Manifest:**\n  - Added necessary permissions: `INTERNET`, `ACCESS_NETWORK_STATE`, `ACCESS_FINE_LOCATION`, `ACCESS_COARSE_LOCATION`.\n- **Data Layer Implementation:**\n  - **Models:** Defined domain models (`User`, `Job`, `TradeProfile`, `ServiceRequest`, `Notification`, `Review`) in `Models.kt`.\n  - **Constants:** Defined trade categories and time slots in `Constants.kt`.\n  - **Persistence:** Created Room entities (`Entities.kt`) and DAOs (`Daos.kt`).\n  - **Database:** Implemented `AppDatabase.kt` with a `DatabaseCallback` to seed the database with initial users, jobs, profiles, and notifications upon first creation.\n  - **Repository:** Created `SahayaRepository.kt` to provide a clean API for the UI layer to interact with the database.\n- **Verification:**\n  - Verified that the project compiles successfully.\n\n### 4. Model Knowledge\n- **Architecture:** The project follows the MVVM pattern. The data layer is abstracted via `SahayaRepository`, which exposes `Flow` streams for reactive UI updates.\n- **Database:** The `AppDatabase` uses Room with KSP. It is pre-seeded with initial data to facilitate testing and development.\n- **Concurrency:** Repository methods that perform mutations (insert/update) are marked `suspend`. Queries return `Flow` to ensure non-blocking UI updates.\n- **Constraints:** The `generate_image` tool failed due to quota limits; custom vector drawables were created manually for the app icon.\n- **System Skills:** The following skills were consulted:\n  - `app_icon_generation`: Used for adaptive icon requirements.\n  - `design_guidelines`: Used for M3 and Compose best practices.\n  - `room_database_integration`: Used for the Room/Repository pattern implementation.\n\n### 5. Files and Code\n- **Edited Files:**\n  - `/metadata.json`: Updated name and description.\n  - `/settings.gradle.kts`: Changed `rootProject.name` to \"Sahaya\".\n  - `/app/src/main/res/values/strings.xml`: Updated `app_name`.\n  - `/app/build.gradle.kts`: Changed `applicationId`.\n  - `/app/src/main/res/drawable/ic_launcher_background.xml`: Replaced with custom gradient and grid.\n  - `/app/src/main/res/drawable/ic_launcher_foreground.xml`: Replaced with custom crest.\n  - `/app/src/main/AndroidManifest.xml`: Added permissions.\n- **Created Files:**\n  - `/app/src/main/java/com/example/data/model/Models.kt`: Domain data models.\n  - `/app/src/main/java/com/example/data/model/Constants.kt`: Trade categories and configuration constants.\n  - `/app/src/main/java/com/example/data/local/Entities.kt`: Room database entities.\n  - `/app/src/main/java/com/example/data/local/Daos.kt`: Room Data Access Objects.\n  - `/app/src/main/java/com/example/data/local/AppDatabase.kt`: Room database configuration and seeding.\n  - `/app/src/main/java/com/example/data/repository/SahayaRepository.kt`: Repository layer.\n- **Viewed Files:**\n  - `/app/src/main/java/com/example/MainActivity.kt`: Entry point for the app.\n  - `/app/src/main/java/com/example/ui/theme/Theme.kt`: Theme configuration.\n\n### 6. Current Work and Next Steps\n- **Current Work:** The data infrastructure is complete.\n- **Next Steps:**\n  - Begin implementing the UI layer.\n  - Start with `MainActivity.kt` to set up navigation and the main screen structure.\n  - Implement screens for the marketplace (Home/Job list, Job Details, Profile).\n- **Relevant Skills (Must re-read):**\n  - `/skills/system_skills/design_guidelines/SKILL.md`: Essential for maintaining consistent M3 design.\n  - `/skills/system_skills/room_database_integration/SKILL.md`: Essential if further database modifications are required."
    included_step_index_end: 66
    conversation_log_uris: "file:///.aistudio/artifacts/brain/26437d04-f70c-4083-9dd2-27925dfa8548/.system_generated/logs/transcript.jsonl"
  }
