    thinking: "**Defining UI Components**\n\nOkay, I\'m currently focused on defining the UI components. I\'ve started fleshing out `StatusBadge.kt`, covering job, escrow, verification statuses, and urgency levels. Next up, I\'m planning out the visual flow for `EscrowStatusBar.kt`, to represent the stages of a job: Created, Accepted, Escrow Held, and Work in Progress.\n\n\n"
