  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining Trade Profiles**\n\nOkay, I\'m now focusing on the UI components for managing worker trade profiles. I\'m generating the code for `MyTradeProfilesScreen.kt` and `CreateTradeProfileScreen.kt`. The design specifies that workers can have up to three profiles across fifteen trade categories. I\'m starting to build the form, which will include a dropdown for the trade category selection.\n\n\n"
