  checkpoint {
    checkpoint_index: 2
    session_summary: "### 1. Outstanding User Requests\n- **Fix Build Errors:** The application failed to compile due to missing parameters in `SahayaRepository` and various unresolved references across the newly created UI screens.\n  - **Status:** IMPLEMENTATION\n- **Verify Navigation Integration:** The `MainActivity` has been updated to host the `NavHost` logic using `SahayaViewModel` state. This needs to be verified once the build issues are resolved.\n  - **Status:** IMPLEMENTATION\n- **Worker-side Implementation:** While the screens are scaffolded, the business logic integration (e.g., `relatedJobId` handling) needs to be finalized to ensure the app is fully functional.\n  - **Status:** IMPLEMENTATION\n\n### 2. User Knowledge\n- **App Concept:** \"Sahaya\" - a two-sided trade services marketplace connecting clients with skilled workers for home repairs, emergency services, and escrow bookings.\n- **Design Preferences:** Use of brand colors: Rich Ocean Blue (`SahayaPrimary`), Craftsman Gold (`SahayaAmber`), and Deep Verified Teal (`SahayaTeal`).\n- **Language Support:** The app must support a toggle between English and Hindi.\n- **Architecture:** MVVM pattern with Room for persistence and `StateFlow` for reactive UI updates.\n- **Navigation:** State-driven navigation via `SahayaViewModel.currentScreen`.\n\n### 3. Work Accomplished\n- **Navigation Implementation:** Implemented `SahayaApp` in `MainActivity.kt`, which observes `SahayaViewModel` states to manage screen switching and bottom navigation for both Client and Worker roles.\n- **Screen Implementation:**\n  - **Client:** Created `JobDetailScreen`, `BrowseTradesScreen`, `WorkerProfileDetailScreen`, `BookServiceScreen`, and `MyServiceRequestsScreen`.\n  - **Worker:** Created `WorkerMarketplaceScreen`, `ActiveJobScreen`, `MyTradeProfilesScreen`, `CreateTradeProfileScreen`, `IncomingRequestsScreen`, and `WalletScreen`.\n- **Theme & Styling:** (From previous sessions) Updated `Color.kt` and `Theme.kt` with the custom Sahaya color palette.\n- **Components:** (From previous sessions) Created a suite of reusable components including `StatusBadge`, `EscrowStatusBar`, `StarRating`, `TradeIcons`, `JobCard`, `WorkerCard`, `RazorpayPaymentDialog`, and `InteractiveJobMap`.\n\n### 4. Model Knowledge\n- **Architecture:** `MainActivity` acts as the primary container, observing `SahayaViewModel` states (`currentUser`, `currentScreen`, `clientTab`, `workerTab`, etc.) to determine the UI composition.\n- **Build Failures:**\n  - **Repository:** `SahayaRepository.kt` requires updates to method signatures to include `relatedJobId`.\n  - **UI Unresolved References:** Several screens (e.g., `BrowseTradesScreen`, `ClientDashboardScreen`) have unresolved references (e.g., `hindiTitle`, `baseHourlyRate`). These likely stem from mismatches between the `Constants` object definition and how they are accessed in the UI.\n  - **Exhaustive `when`:** `MyServiceRequestsScreen` has an incomplete `when` expression for `RequestStatus`.\n  - **Type Inference:** `PostJobScreen` and `CreateTradeProfileScreen` have type inference errors in their composable logic.\n- **Constraints:** The app uses `StateFlow` for all data streams. Repository methods are `suspend` functions.\n\n### 5. Files and Code\n\n#### Edited Files\n- `/app/src/main/java/com/example/MainActivity.kt`: Implemented full navigation logic using `SahayaViewModel` state and bottom navigation bars.\n- `/app/src/main/java/com/example/data/repository/SahayaRepository.kt`: (Needs update) Missing `relatedJobId` parameter in repository methods.\n\n#### Created Files\n- `/app/src/main/java/com/example/ui/screens/client/`:\n  - `JobDetailScreen.kt`, `BrowseTradesScreen.kt`, `WorkerProfileDetailScreen.kt`, `BookServiceScreen.kt`, `MyServiceRequestsScreen.kt`.\n- `/app/src/main/java/com/example/ui/screens/worker/`:\n  - `WorkerMarketplaceScreen.kt`, `ActiveJobScreen.kt`, `MyTradeProfilesScreen.kt`, `CreateTradeProfileScreen.kt`, `IncomingRequestsScreen.kt`, `WalletScreen.kt`.\n\n#### Viewed Files\n- `/app/src/main/java/com/example/data/model/Constants.kt`: Contains `TRADE_CATEGORIES` and `TIME_SLOTS`.\n- `/app/src/main/java/com/example/data/model/Models.kt`: Contains data models (`Job`, `TradeProfile`, `ServiceRequest`, etc.).\n\n### 6. Current Work and Next Steps\n- **Current Work:** The project is in a broken build state. The immediate priority is to resolve the compilation errors identified in the build logs.\n- **Next Steps:**\n  1.  **Fix Repository:** Update `SahayaRepository.kt` to include the `relatedJobId` parameter where required.\n  2.  **Fix Constants/UI Mismatches:** Audit `BrowseTradesScreen.kt`, `ClientDashboardScreen.kt`, and `CreateTradeProfileScreen.kt` to ensure they match the properties defined in `Constants.kt` (e.g., check `nameHi` vs `hindiTitle`).\n  3.  **Fix Exhaustive `when`:** Update `MyServiceRequestsScreen.kt` to handle all `RequestStatus` cases.\n  4.  **Fix Type Inference:** Resolve type inference issues in `PostJobScreen.kt` and `CreateTradeProfileScreen.kt`.\n  5.  **Recompile:** Run the build again to verify the fix."
