    thinking: "**Reviewing Color Defaults**\n\nI\'ve been reviewing the `Theme.kt` file and noticed that `dynamicColor` defaults to `false`. My current thought is that this should be the default for the custom Bento Grid color scheme to apply consistently. I\'ve also checked the color palette from the Bento Grid HTML and have started mapping some examples, for instance `bg-[#FDF7FF]` is `Color(0xFFFDF7FF)`.\n\n\n**Mapping Color Relationships**\n\nI\'ve continued mapping colors, translating hex codes to `Color` objects, and making notes. I\'m focusing on key relationships, like the \"Deep slate on-surface\" color and primary/secondary colors. I\'m also cataloging accent colors for different states, like success and emergency. I\'ve begun to consider Bento\'s card aesthetic, thinking about rounded corners and borders.\n\n\n"
