  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Implementing Bento Grid Design**\n\nI\'m now focusing on implementing the Bento Grid layout across the client dashboard and entire application. Key initial steps involve the header design. It needs an avatar circle with initials, using BentoPrimary color. I\'m also thinking of how to best integrate Bento Grid elements for optimal user experience and intuitive visual navigation. I am considering best practices for adaptability to other viewports and data visualizations.\n\n\n**Designing Hero Sections**\n\nI\'ve been working on the hero section\'s visual design. I\'m focusing on incorporating the client\'s name and a notification button into the header. The hero Bento Tile is taking shape, featuring a prominent metric display and \"Escrow Protected\" messaging. I\'m experimenting with rounded corners and border strokes for a clean look, particularly in the big card. I\'m also planning the smaller 2-column modules\' structure and using a squircle icon container.\n\n\n"
