  planner_response {
    response: "I have completed the implementation of the **Bento Grid** design theme for Sahaya, bringing modular visual structure, balanced card grids, and refined Material 3 styling throughout the app:\n\n- **Bento Visual Identity & Palette**:\n  - Implemented the Bento color system with warm lilac background canvas (`#FDF7FF`), soft secondary containers (`#F3EDF7`), primary accents (`#6750A4`), rich container tones (`#EADDFF`), and high-contrast dark tiles (`#1C1B1F`).\n  - Structured card elements with 20\342\200\22328dp squircle corners and subtle 1dp border outlines (`#CAC4D0`).\n\n- **Client Dashboard Bento Layout**:\n  - **Span-2 Hero Vault Tile**: Features a lilac gradient container showcasing milestone escrow metrics, live status badge, and rapid job-posting action.\n  - **Modular Dual Square Tiles**: Arranged a verified trades discovery tile (`15 Trade Categories`) alongside an interactive Quick Actions hub (`Post Task`, `Book Pro`, `Urgent SOS`).\n  - **High-Contrast Dark Emergency Tile**: Rapid dispatch emergency SOS tile in dark slate with active emergency dispatch badges.\n  - **Bento Category Carousel & Cards**: Styled trade categories and job cards with rounded squircle icon containers, base rate tags, and crisp typography.\n\n- **Bento Navigation & Worker Payouts**:\n  - Redesigned bottom navigation bars with soft container tones, active pill indicators, and subtle top borders.\n  - Formatted the worker wallet with dark slate balance cards, secure milestone escrow badges, and rounded transaction cards.\n  - Fully verified test suites and builds (`BUILD SUCCESSFUL`)."
    modified_response: "I have completed the implementation of the **Bento Grid** design theme for Sahaya, bringing modular visual structure, balanced card grids, and refined Material 3 styling throughout the app:\n\n- **Bento Visual Identity & Palette**:\n  - Implemented the Bento color system with warm lilac background canvas (`#FDF7FF`), soft secondary containers (`#F3EDF7`), primary accents (`#6750A4`), rich container tones (`#EADDFF`), and high-contrast dark tiles (`#1C1B1F`).\n  - Structured card elements with 20\342\200\22328dp squircle corners and subtle 1dp border outlines (`#CAC4D0`).\n\n- **Client Dashboard Bento Layout**:\n  - **Span-2 Hero Vault Tile**: Features a lilac gradient container showcasing milestone escrow metrics, live status badge, and rapid job-posting action.\n  - **Modular Dual Square Tiles**: Arranged a verified trades discovery tile (`15 Trade Categories`) alongside an interactive Quick Actions hub (`Post Task`, `Book Pro`, `Urgent SOS`).\n  - **High-Contrast Dark Emergency Tile**: Rapid dispatch emergency SOS tile in dark slate with active emergency dispatch badges.\n  - **Bento Category Carousel & Cards**: Styled trade categories and job cards with rounded squircle icon containers, base rate tags, and crisp typography.\n\n- **Bento Navigation & Worker Payouts**:\n  - Redesigned bottom navigation bars with soft container tones, active pill indicators, and subtle top borders.\n  - Formatted the worker wallet with dark slate balance cards, secure milestone escrow badges, and rounded transaction cards.\n  - Fully verified test suites and builds (`BUILD SUCCESSFUL`)."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
